{"title": "Superior Darkvision", "pageid": 3956, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Superior_Darkvision", "categories": ["Bugs", "Class features", "Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the same passive grants to Shadow Magic sorcerers, see <a href=\"/wiki/Eyes_of_the_Dark\" title=\"Eyes of the Dark\">Eyes of the Dark</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Superior_Darkvision.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Superior_Darkvision.webp/300px-Superior_Darkvision.webp, /w/images/4/4e/Superior_Darkvision.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Superior_Darkvision.webp/300px-Superior_Darkvision.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Superior_Darkvision.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Superior Darkvision</b> is a passive feature that prevents <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> when attacking creatures in the dark within 24 m (80 ft), double the distance of normal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/38px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/50px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Can see in the dark up to 24 m (80 ft). \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Gloom_Stalker\" title=\"Gloom Stalker\">Gloom Stalker</a></li></ul>\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Duergar\">Duergar</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Deep_Gnome\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deep Gnome\">Deep Gnome</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aminah\" title=\"Aminah\">Aminah</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Anouk\" title=\"Anouk\">Anouk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Argram\" title=\"Argram\">Argram</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\">Barcus Wroot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Beldron\" title=\"Beldron\">Beldron</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Belub\" title=\"Belub\">Belub</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bonna\" title=\"Bonna\">Bonna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brathwen\" title=\"Brathwen\">Brathwen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brithvar\" title=\"Brithvar\">Brithvar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brounce\" title=\"Brounce\">Brounce</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bumpnagel\" title=\"Bumpnagel\">Bumpnagel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dalthar\" title=\"Dalthar\">Dalthar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Danna\" title=\"Danna\">Danna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Drar\" title=\"Drar\">Drar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar_Spore_Servant_(guard_caster)\" title=\"Duergar Spore Servant (guard caster)\">Duergar Spore Servant (guard caster)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dulbers_Frint\" title=\"Dulbers Frint\">Dulbers Frint</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dunnol\" title=\"Dunnol\">Dunnol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elenna_Thrinn\" title=\"Elenna Thrinn\">Elenna Thrinn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fonmara\" title=\"Fonmara\">Fonmara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fuffi_Fuffers\" title=\"Fuffi Fuffers\">Fuffi Fuffers</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fulguro\" title=\"Fulguro\">Fulguro</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Garmor\" title=\"Garmor\">Garmor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gekh_Coal\" title=\"Gekh Coal\">Gekh Coal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gergerann\" title=\"Gergerann\">Gergerann</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gipkins_Jared\" title=\"Gipkins Jared\">Gipkins Jared</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greymon\" title=\"Greymon\">Greymon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grumm\" title=\"Grumm\">Grumm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grundril\" title=\"Grundril\">Grundril</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Havkelaag\" title=\"Havkelaag\">Havkelaag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hogi_Nuners\" title=\"Hogi Nuners\">Hogi Nuners</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Holvik\" title=\"Holvik\">Holvik</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hurk\" title=\"Hurk\">Hurk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jerris\" title=\"Jerris\">Jerris</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kettel\" title=\"Kettel\">Kettel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kirgrath\" title=\"Kirgrath\">Kirgrath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kith\" title=\"Kith\">Kith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kree_Derryck\" title=\"Kree Derryck\">Kree Derryck</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kur\" title=\"Kur\">Kur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Laridda\" title=\"Laridda\">Laridda</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Elemental\" title=\"Lava Elemental\">Lava Elemental</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lorlarrio\" title=\"Lorlarrio\">Lorlarrio</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lunkbug\" title=\"Lunkbug\">Lunkbug</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lurgan\" title=\"Lurgan\">Lurgan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Magmar\" title=\"Magmar\">Magmar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Meerna\" title=\"Meerna\">Meerna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mirthis\" title=\"Mirthis\">Mirthis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Moorcombe\" title=\"Moorcombe\">Moorcombe</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morghal\" title=\"Morghal\">Morghal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morgya\" title=\"Morgya\">Morgya</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Murmath\" title=\"Murmath\">Murmath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Orgarth\" title=\"Orgarth\">Orgarth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Philomeen\" title=\"Philomeen\">Philomeen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pistle\" title=\"Pistle\">Pistle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Needle_Blight\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Needle Blight\">Shadow-Cursed Needle Blight</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Duergar\" title=\"Shattered Duergar\">Shattered Duergar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skarjall\" title=\"Skarjall\">Skarjall</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skickpit\" title=\"Skickpit\">Skickpit</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thudd\" title=\"Thudd\">Thudd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thulla\" title=\"Thulla\">Thulla</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ver%27yll_Wenkiir\" title=\"Ver'yll Wenkiir\">Ver'yll Wenkiir</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Viss\" title=\"Viss\">Viss</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Welso\" title=\"Welso\">Welso</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wicky\" title=\"Wicky\">Wicky</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wrint_Sprigley\" title=\"Wrint Sprigley\">Wrint Sprigley</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_Minthara\" title=\"Zombie Minthara\">Zombie Minthara</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>When a <a href=\"/wiki/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">hiding</a> creature enters the line of sight of a non-allied creature with superior darkvision, and is within the range of superior darkvision:\n<ul><li>Being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightly Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\">Lightly Obscured</a> counts as being under <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clear_Area_(Condition)\" title=\"Clear Area (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Clear Area\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clear_Area_(Condition)\" title=\"Clear Area (Condition)\">Clear Area</a> instead.</li>\n<li>Being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavily Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\">Heavily Obscured</a> counts as being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightly Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\">Lightly Obscured</a> instead.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The passive vision cone from Superior Darkvision is non-functional for Duergar. They possess both the 'Darkvision' and 'Superior Darkvision' passives, and because of how the conflict between these two is resolved by the game-engine for this race, the smaller vision cone from standard Darkvision always overwrites the larger one from Superior Darkvision. However, Superior Darkvision still prevents Disadvantage from a larger distance (24 m (80 ft)) compared to standard Darkvision (12 m (40 ft)).</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195321\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1997/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19900/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9526/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3958/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 926047/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   67.589      1 -total\n 99.47%   67.234      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 32.26%   21.805      1 Template:PageSeo\n 31.84%   21.519      1 Template:Hi